<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Interpretable Graph-Language Modeling for Detecting 
<br class="ltx_break">Youth Illicit Drug Use</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Yiyang Li
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_email"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Email: </span><a href="mailto:"><span id="id1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">yli62@nd.edu</span></a>
</span></span></span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
