<span id="A4.F8.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.F8.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Cues about learned relations:<span id="A4.F8.pic1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">
Think about the possible relations between <span id="A4.F8.pic1.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">PRNTS LIMITED YOUR TIME OUT W/FRNDS PST 12 MOS</span> and <span id="A4.F8.pic1.2.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">HOW MANY SDNTS YOU KNOW GET DRUNK WEEKLY</span> given the user’s answers to them.
<br class="ltx_break">Think about the possible relations between <span id="A4.F8.pic1.2.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">RC-POVERTY LEVEL-NEW INC (% OF US CENSUS POVERTY THRESHOLD)</span> and <span id="A4.F8.pic1.2.1.1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">FELT WORTHLESS NEARLY EVERY DAY</span> given the user’s answers to them.
<br class="ltx_break">Think about the possible relations between <span id="A4.F8.pic1.2.1.1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">EVER VAPED NICOTINE WITH E-CIGARETTE OR OTHER VAPING DEVICE</span> and <span id="A4.F8.pic1.2.1.1.1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">HOW YOU FELT OVERALL ABT GOING TO SCHL PAST 12 MOS</span> given the user’s answers to them.
<br class="ltx_break">Think about the possible relations between <span id="A4.F8.pic1.2.1.1.1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">CARRIED A HANDGUN</span> and <span id="A4.F8.pic1.2.1.1.1.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">PRNTS LET YOU KNOW DONE A GOOD JOB PST 12 MOS</span> given the user’s answers to them.
<br class="ltx_break">Think about the possible relations between <span id="A4.F8.pic1.2.1.1.1.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">HOW MANY SDNTS YOU KNOW IN GRADE SMOKE CIGARETTES</span> and <span id="A4.F8.pic1.2.1.1.1.10" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">INABILITY TO CONCENTRATE OR MAKE DECISIONS</span> given the user’s answers to them.</span></span></span>
<span id="A4.F8.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.F8.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Following Prompt:<span id="A4.F8.pic1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">
Based on these facts, can you infer whether this user uses illicit drugs?
Please answer "Yes" or "No" and explain why.</span></span></span>
